      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Thread:::Abort() and wait for done takes up to 2.5 seconds because of this.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "COULD replace this mechanism (in the ConditionVariable code) with a linked list of waiting condtion variables and then interrupt would wake each of them (and they could recheck there test sand thread local abort variables).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "OR - could MAYBE somehow use jthread (not sure how - may fall out of that). Try doing jthread stuff first to see.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
